    "body": "The existing max-conflict  cases fail on the parent alone, so the package-level limit check never runs. The new case uses a 0-fee parent so the package is evaluated as a whole. The parent hits the limit and the child's one extra conflict pushes it over.\n\n\nIt kills mutant https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4673 (fails in `test_package_rbf_max_conflicts`):\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/validation.cpp b/src/validation.cpp\nindex 57048ac374..2bb5188046 100644\n--- a/src/validation.cpp\n+++ b/src/validation.cpp\n@@ -1067,7 +1067,7 @@ bool MemPoolAccept::PackageRBFChecks(const std::vector<CTransactionRef>& txns,\n     // This limit is not increased in a package RBF. Use the aggregate number of transactions.\n     CTxMemPool::setEntries all_conflicts;\n     if (const auto err_string{GetEntriesForConflicts(*child_ws.m_ptx, m_pool, direct_conflict_iters,\n-                                                     all_conflicts)}) {\n+                                                     all_conflicts)}; false) {\n         return package_state.Invalid(PackageValidationResult::PCKG_POLICY,\n                                      \"package RBF failed: too many potential replacements\", *err_string);\n     }\n```\n",
    "labels": [
