      "message": "test: cover package RBF conflict limit\n\nThe existing max-conflict cases fail on the parent alone, so the\npackage-level conflict limit check in PackageRBFChecks never runs.\n\nAdd a case with a zero fee parent so the package is evaluated as a\nwhole. The parent conflicts with 100 clusters and the child adds one\nextra, which exceeds the limit.",
